    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 272, 500, 24]
    content:
      style: "$sec"
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 01 · 前提 PREMISE
  - elementId: premise-big
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 308, 952, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 38
      fontFamily: 汇文明朝体
      color: "$accent"
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: AI 是放大器：放大你的能力，也放大你的缺失。
  - elementId: prem-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 380, 400, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$faint"
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 精确定义 · 形式化表述
  - elementId: premise-def
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 404, 952, 44]
    content:
      fontFamily: 汇文明朝体
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:30px; color:$ink">AI</span><span style="font-size:30px; color:$ink"> ＝ </span><span style="font-size:30px; color:$accent">±</span><span style="font-size:34px; color:$ink">Σ</span><sup><span style="font-size:15px; color:$dim">n→∞</span></sup><span style="font-size:24px; color:$ink">（意图 ＋ 倾向 ＋ 能力 ＋ 偏差 ＋ ⋯ ＋ n）</span></p>
  - elementId: prem-tail
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 454, 952, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$faint"
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "± ：正向与负向皆有可能——放大人的意图、倾向、能力与偏差，也放大组织的流程与制度；后果的方向由人判断和负责。"
  - elementId: premise-meta
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 480, 952, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$dim"
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 元前提：本框架可证伪、可被推翻、可被优化；公理不作盾牌——出现矛盾案例、反事实场景时，重新评估框架本身。
  - elementId: div2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 514, 952, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}

  # ===== 02 负效应表 =====
  - elementId: sec2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 548, 700, 24]
    content:
      style: "$sec"
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 02 · 负效应 ＝ 缺失被放大
  - elementId: neg-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [64, 584, 952, 396]
    columnWidths: [0.42, 0.58]
    rowHeights: [0.12, 0.176, 0.176, 0.176, 0.176, 0.176]
